2a:["$","p","25",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Klaviyo"}],"'s 2026 upgrade introduced \"Privacy-First Segmentation,\" allowing segmentation using only zero- and first-party signals—no third-party cookies or device graphs. This drove a 44% increase in opt-in rates for GDPR/CCPA-compliant brands."]}]
